  <!--EN: One of them walks among us. We should expel the android from our home.-->
  <VRE_AndroidColonist_Despised.stages.0.description>我们的殖民地中有人形存在。必须把这些可憎的家伙赶出去！</VRE_AndroidColonist_Despised.stages.0.description>
  <!--EN: android among us-->
  <VRE_AndroidColonist_Despised.stages.0.label>殖民地有人形</VRE_AndroidColonist_Despised.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: The only good android is a dead one.-->
  <VRE_AndroidDied_Despised.stages.0.description>只有死了的人形才是好人形。</VRE_AndroidDied_Despised.stages.0.description>
  <!--EN: android died-->
  <VRE_AndroidDied_Despised.stages.0.label>人形死亡</VRE_AndroidDied_Despised.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: I am what I hate. My whole existence is aberrant.-->
  <VRE_AndroidSelfHatred_Despised.stages.0.description>我真的好恨！为什么我是人形而不是人类啊？</VRE_AndroidSelfHatred_Despised.stages.0.description>
  <!--EN: android self hatred-->
